{%- comment -%}
  MY TAPE STORE — WELCOME  ·  Shopify Email "Custom Liquid" block

  WHERE THIS GOES
  Marketing > Automations > Welcome (new subscriber) > edit the email, then:
    1. header/logo block image -> mts-email-header-white.png, width maximum
    2. delete every OTHER block
    3. keep ONE Custom Liquid block and paste all of this into it

  CONSENT
  This is the one automation with no consent question attached: it only fires
  when somebody has just opted in. It is also the moment they are most willing
  to hear from you, which is why it is four lines and a link rather than a
  brochure.

  EMOJI
  Four, one per claim, each mapped to something the store actually promises on
  its own announcement bar -- range, delivery, Australian ownership, volume
  pricing. They are Unicode text, not images, so they render everywhere without
  a download and survive an image-blocking client. Used as list markers only;
  none appear in the headline, where they would read as consumer-retail on a
  list that is 52% businesses and 13% schools.
{%- endcomment -%}

<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"
       style="background:#f4f2ef;margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;">
  <tr><td align="center" style="padding:0;background:#f4f2ef;">

    <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"
           style="width:100%;max-width:600px;background:#ffffff;">

